{"id":86,"name":"الطارق","transliteration":"At-Tariq","translation_fr":"L'astre nocturne","translation_en":"The Nightcommer","type":"meccan","total_verses":17,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلطَّارِقِ","translation_fr":"Par le ciel et par l'astre nocturne","translation_en":"By the sky and the night comer","transliteration":"Waalssamai waalttariqi"},{"id":2,"text":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلطَّارِقُ","translation_fr":"Et qui te dira ce qu'est l'astre nocturne","translation_en":"And what can make you know what is the night comer","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma alttariqu"},{"id":3,"text":"ٱلنَّجۡمُ ٱلثَّاقِبُ","translation_fr":"C'est l'étoile vivement brillante","translation_en":"It is the piercing star","transliteration":"Alnnajmu alththaqibu"},{"id":4,"text":"إِن كُلُّ نَفۡسٖ لَّمَّا عَلَيۡهَا حَافِظٞ","translation_fr":"Il n'est pas d'âme qui n'ait sur elle un gardien","translation_en":"There is no soul but that it has over it a protector","transliteration":"In kullu nafsin lamma AAalayha hafithun"},{"id":5,"text":"فَلۡيَنظُرِ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ","translation_fr":"Que l'homme considère donc de quoi il a été créé","translation_en":"So let man observe from what he was created","transliteration":"Falyanthuri alinsanu mimma khuliqa"},{"id":6,"text":"خُلِقَ مِن مَّآءٖ دَافِقٖ","translation_fr":"Il a été créé d'une giclée d'eau","translation_en":"He was created from a fluid, ejected","transliteration":"Khuliqa min main dafiqin"},{"id":7,"text":"يَخۡرُجُ مِنۢ بَيۡنِ ٱلصُّلۡبِ وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","translation_fr":"sortie d'entre les lombes et les côtes","translation_en":"Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs","transliteration":"Yakhruju min bayni alssulbi waalttaraibi"},{"id":8,"text":"إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ رَجۡعِهِۦ لَقَادِرٞ","translation_fr":"Allah est certes capable de le ressusciter","translation_en":"Indeed, Allah, to return him [to life], is Able","transliteration":"Innahu AAala rajAAihi laqadirun"},{"id":9,"text":"يَوۡمَ تُبۡلَى ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ","translation_fr":"Le jour où les cœurs dévoileront leurs secrets","translation_en":"The Day when secrets will be put on trial","transliteration":"Yawma tubla alssarairu"},{"id":10,"text":"فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن قُوَّةٖ وَلَا نَاصِرٖ","translation_fr":"Il n'aura alors ni force ni secoureur","translation_en":"Then man will have no power or any helper","transliteration":"Fama lahu min quwwatin wala nasirin"},{"id":11,"text":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلرَّجۡعِ","translation_fr":"Par le ciel qui fait revenir la pluie","translation_en":"By the sky which returns [rain]","transliteration":"Waalssamai thati alrrajAAi"},{"id":12,"text":"وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ ذَاتِ ٱلصَّدۡعِ","translation_fr":"et par la terre qui se fend","translation_en":"And [by] the earth which cracks open","transliteration":"Waalardi thati alssadAAi"},{"id":13,"text":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوۡلٞ فَصۡلٞ","translation_fr":"Ceci [le Coran] est certes, une parole décisive [qui tranche entre le vrai et le faux]","translation_en":"Indeed, the Qur'an is a decisive statement","transliteration":"Innahu laqawlun faslun"},{"id":14,"text":"وَمَا هُوَ بِٱلۡهَزۡلِ","translation_fr":"et non point une plaisanterie frivole","translation_en":"And it is not amusement","transliteration":"Wama huwa bialhazli"},{"id":15,"text":"إِنَّهُمۡ يَكِيدُونَ كَيۡدٗا","translation_fr":"Ils se servent d'une ruse","translation_en":"Indeed, they are planning a plan","transliteration":"Innahum yakeedoona kaydan"},{"id":16,"text":"وَأَكِيدُ كَيۡدٗا","translation_fr":"et Moi aussi Je me sers de Mon plan","translation_en":"But I am planning a plan","transliteration":"Waakeedu kaydan"},{"id":17,"text":"فَمَهِّلِ ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ أَمۡهِلۡهُمۡ رُوَيۡدَۢا","translation_fr":"Accorde (ô Prophète) donc un délai aux infidèles: accorde-leur un court délai","translation_en":"So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile","transliteration":"Famahhili alkafireena amhilhum ruwaydan"}]}